{"4658110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ArtificialOverthrow", "steam_appid": 4658110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•Different Shapes, Same Killer Instinct </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/21bdbfe841d9ce56c0397d84b02ae4bd.avif?t=1787257759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras_big/21bdbfe841d9ce56c0397d84b02ae4bd.webp?t=1787257759 width=1560 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether swarming you at relentless high speeds or raining down fire from afar, these AI puppeted automatons have different ways to lower your chances of survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > •No Breaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/70649859f0a8355a2464ece6e90bcb64.avif?t=1787257759\" width=1522 height=715 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Slowing Down You may be an employee but the idea of “breaks” is completely out the window! Enemies are constantly around and always moving, and the second they catch sight of you…well you better hope you have ammo otherwise you’ll be overrun quickly and killed <i>painfully</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•EMP Assist </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/c6a1fd1393af6cd4da10cfafd4367e90.avif?t=1787257759\" width=1045 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel like you’re close to being overrun, utilize the EMPs scattered in the area to put an immediate halt to their advances </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•Alone but Armed </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/c90cabbf51cc475f21316f914224f997.avif?t=1787257759\" width=905 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re completely alone with multiple bots prowling in the building, however you’re armed with 2 different ranged weapons to help turn the murderous rogue creations to nothing but scrap. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•Different Shapes, Same Killer Instinct </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/21bdbfe841d9ce56c0397d84b02ae4bd.avif?t=1787257759\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras_big/21bdbfe841d9ce56c0397d84b02ae4bd.webp?t=1787257759 width=1560 height=465 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Whether swarming you at relentless high speeds or raining down fire from afar, these AI puppeted automatons have different ways to lower your chances of survival</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > •No Breaks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/70649859f0a8355a2464ece6e90bcb64.avif?t=1787257759\" width=1522 height=715 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Slowing Down You may be an employee but the idea of “breaks” is completely out the window! Enemies are constantly around and always moving, and the second they catch sight of you…well you better hope you have ammo otherwise you’ll be overrun quickly and killed <i>painfully</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•EMP Assist </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/c6a1fd1393af6cd4da10cfafd4367e90.avif?t=1787257759\" width=1045 height=495 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever feel like you’re close to being overrun, utilize the EMPs scattered in the area to put an immediate halt to their advances </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >•Alone but Armed </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/extras/c90cabbf51cc475f21316f914224f997.avif?t=1787257759\" width=905 height=275 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re completely alone with multiple bots prowling in the building, however you’re armed with 2 different ranged weapons to help turn the murderous rogue creations to nothing but scrap. </p>", "short_description": "1st person arcade shooter. AI slop has overtaken Better Than All Robotics Headquarters and corrupted its machines. Its up to you as the last remaining Security guard to fight back. Reduce the rogue creations to nothing but scrap using both weapons and scattered EMPs in endless combat", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/b1992ed11e1821975fb7515bd80d71a17c7f3813/header.jpg?t=1787257759", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/62c1313b95311c792047a657adb0c48bd2d534ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787257759", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4658110/62c1313b95311c792047a657adb0c48bd2d534ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787257759", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows 10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 6gb / RX 5